# Echostash scan/track output (per-repo manifest store) — local cache, not shared.
# Note the pattern is `.echostash/*`, not `.echostash/`: git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is excluded, and MCP audit baselines below must stay committable.
.echostash/*

# ...except MCP audit baselines, which are meant to be committed — the CI gate compares the
# current tool surface against them, so a local-only baseline would make the gate a no-op.
!.echostash/mcp-baseline.*.json
